# Purpose
Explains how to build focused review checklists with a clear purpose, review
scope, and specific checklist items.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Start with the purpose.
- Define what is being reviewed.
- Keep checklist items specific.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Checklist items should be observable and actionable, not vague quality goals.

